### Actualizar un servicio ofrecido
PUT http://localhost:3000/offered-services/bb4d742b-bd51-4afa-8931-537013dc4be6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customPrice": 2800,
  "customDuration": 50
}

### Eliminar un servicio ofrecido
DELETE http://localhost:3000/offered-services/bb4d742b-bd51-4afa-8931-537013dc4be6
 
